      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Let your customers perform a wide range of logistics tasks for last-mile delivery. Implement delivery fleet management to automate and digitize the fleet owner’s business.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Equip commercial fleets with a tool for truckers and a mobile application for drivers. Day-to-day order import and distribution, planning and optimization of routes, delivery control, reports, notifications and options for third-party integrations are at the disposal of the fleet owner. Wialon combines GPS tracking, IoT and fleet management to drive more profit from delivery fleets. Download demo</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "Let your customers perform a wide range of logistics tasks for last-mile delivery. Implement delivery fleet management to automate and digitize the fleet owner’s business.Equip commercial fleets with a tool for truckers and a mobile application for drivers. Day-to-day order import and distribution, planning and optimization of routes, delivery control, reports, notifications and options for third-party integrations are at the disposal of the fleet owner. Wialon combines GPS tracking, IoT and fleet management to drive more profit from delivery fleets. Download demo",
